# VerityLakefront — dense forest approach to Lake Verity (Platinum-style).
# Legend: T tree  . grass  , tall/shaded gap  : sand  f flower  L ledge
#          S sign  W warp → Lake Verity
# Tree bands use even row/col spans so 2×2 stamps never strand rock orphans.
@name VerityLakefront
@layout LAYOUT_VERITY_LAKEFRONT
@width 32
@height 18
@primary gTileset_General
@secondary gTileset_Petalburg
@connection right MAP_ROUTE201 -11
@warp MAP_LAKE_VERITY 0
@warp MAP_LAKE_VERITY 1
@sign VerityLakefront_EventScript_Sign
@grid
